    </nav>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-line" onclick="showToast('Demo login selected')">Sign in</button>
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="#start">Get started</a>
      <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="mobile-sheet" id="mobileSheet">
  <a href="#how">How it works</a>
  <a href="#features">Features</a>
  <a href="#studio">Interview studio</a>
  <a href="#start">Get started</a>
</div>

<main id="top">
<section class="container hero">
  <div>
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">A resume and interview workspace, built for students who'd rather prepare than guess.</p>
    <h1>Somewhere between doubt and the interview room, there is clarity.</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">CareerAI reads your resume the way a mentor would — naming what's strong, flagging what's missing, and turning it into questions you can actually rehearse.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="#start">Analyze my resume</a>
      <a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">See how it works</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-trust">
      <span><i></i> Resume &amp; ATS review</span>
      <span><i></i> Skill gap mapping</span>
      <span><i></i> Mock interview practice</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <div class="pond">
      <svg class="koi-svg" viewBox="0 0 240 240" fill="none">
        <path d="M120,14 A106,106 0 0,1 226,120" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".28"/>
        <path d="M226,120 A106,106 0 0,1 120,226" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".3"/>
        <path d="M120,226 A106,106 0 0,1 16,126" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".26"/>
        <path d="M18,110 A106,106 0 0,1 108,15" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".32"/>

        <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="78" fill="var(--paper-deep)"/>

        <g class="fin-detail">
          <path d="M120,44 A76,76 0 0,1 120,196 A38,38 0 0,1 120,120 A38,38 0 0,0 120,44 Z" fill="var(--saffron)"/>
          <path d="M120,196 A76,76 0 0,1 120,44 A38,38 0 0,1 120,120 A38,38 0 0,0 120,196 Z" fill="var(--paper)"/>

          <path d="M118,50 C126,58 130,70 122,80 C114,72 112,58 118,50 Z" fill="var(--gold)" opacity=".85"/>
          <circle cx="120" cy="66" r="3.4" fill="var(--ink)"/>
          <path d="M108,58 L96,52 M108,64 L94,64" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".5"/>
          <path d="M132,182 L142,190 M128,188 L136,198" stroke="var(--saffron)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>

          <path d="M122,190 C130,182 126,170 118,160 C126,172 122,184 122,190 Z" fill="var(--koi)" opacity=".8"/>
          <circle cx="120" cy="174" r="3.4" fill="var(--paper)"/>
          <path d="M132,182 L144,178 M132,188 L146,190" stroke="var(--paper)" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".7"/>
          <path d="M108,58 L98,50 M104,52 L94,42" stroke="var(--koi)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <p class="pond-caption">Every koi swims upstream before it becomes a dragon.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="strip">
  <div class="container strip-row">
    <div class="strip-item">
      <svg class="strip-ring" viewBox="0 0 30 30"><circle cx="15" cy="15" r="12" stroke="var(--koi)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none" opacity=".5"/><circle cx="15" cy="15" r="4" fill="var(--saffron)"/></svg>
      <p>One upload gives you a section-by-section read of your resume, not just a single pass/fail number.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="strip-item">
      <svg class="strip-ring" viewBox="0 0 30 30"><circle cx="15" cy="15" r="12" stroke="var(--koi)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none" opacity=".5"/><circle cx="15" cy="15" r="4" fill="var(--saffron)"/></svg>
      <p>Interview questions are pulled from the role and company you're actually targeting, not a generic bank.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="strip-item">
      <svg class="strip-ring" viewBox="0 0 30 30"><circle cx="15" cy="15" r="12" stroke="var(--koi)" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none" opacity=".5"/><circle cx="15" cy="15" r="4" fill="var(--saffron)"/></svg>
      <p>Every practice session is logged, so improvement is something you can point to, not just something you feel.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container" id="features">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Six ways to stop guessing and start preparing.</h2>
    <p>A resume tells one story. CareerAI helps you read it clearly, close the gaps it reveals, and rehearse the conversation it leads to.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="bento">
    <article class="card large">
      <span class="tag">Core</span>
      <svg class="card-ring" viewBox="0 0 44 44"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="17" stroke="var(--koi)" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" opacity=".4"/><path d="M22,6 A16,16 0 0,1 22,38 A8,8 0 0,1 22,22 A8,8 0 0,0 22,6 Z" fill="var(--saffron)"/></svg>
      <h3>Resume intelligence</h3>
      <p>An ATS-style score paired with section-level notes on structure, clarity and impact — the kind of feedback you'd get from a mentor who's read a thousand resumes.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card large">
      <svg class="card-ring" viewBox="0 0 44 44"><circle cx="22" cy="22" r="17" stroke="var(--koi)" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none" opacity=".4"/><path d="M22,6 A16,16 0 0,1 22,38 A8,8 0 0,1 22,22 A8,8 0 0,0 22,6 Z" fill="var(--gold)"/></svg>
      <h3>Skill gap map</h3>
      <p>Set a target role and see it side by side with your profile — which strengths already carry weight, and which skills are worth building before you apply.</p>
    </article>

    <arti
